0..78 Comment "// A record type\'s faces refused: one face holds a label the record lacks, and"
79..159 Comment "// one face is named twice. A static bracket refused: it names a field or a face"
160..185 Comment "// the record type lacks."
186..188 Comment "//"
189..266 Comment "// A face lists only labels its record holds, and each face has its own name."
267..324 Comment "// The refusal stands at the label or at the second name."
325..401 Comment "// A static bracket fixes only the fields its record type writes, and a face"
402..478 Comment "// only when the type member names it. The refusal stands at the label or at"
479..504 Comment "// the face, by its name."
505..507 Comment "//"
508..584 Comment "// The types stand in a module, whose members carry the verdict each refusal"
585..644 Comment "// states. Each refusal names the face and the record type."
645..647 Comment "//"
648..730 Comment "// - see: `model/desc/record-faces.gandr` — the faces read, and the bracket read"
731..812 Comment "// - see: `pathological/desc/shaped-signature.gandr` — a theory\'s faces refused"
813..823 Comment "//   alike"
